Title: Judge's Crossword Puzzle No. 10
Author: Joseph Moreland
Date: 1925-01-03
Byline: The above Puzzle was contributed by Joseph Moreland, 1 Minetta Place, New York City.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1925-01-03_88/page/n34/mode/1up
Number: 10
